      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "bruno.jaques@macnicadhw.com.br",
      "alt": "MBa6ULx boardTQMa335xL Embedded LGA module",
      "text": "<h1>Based on Cortex®-A8 (AM335x) with graphics and real-time support</h1>\n<p>The TQMa335xL is an embedded LGA module based on Cortex®-A8 (AM335x) with graphics and real-time support. It features a real-time communication subsystem, ensuring precise timing, and exhibits low power consumption (typ. 2 W) for energy efficiency. With 2x IEEE1588 Ethernet (L2 Switch) and long-term availability, it offers reliable connectivity and longevity in deployment. This module, based on an Arm® Cortex®-A8 core running up to 1 GHz, is designed for high-volume projects and is ideal for visualization and control applications with real-time demands. It provides a wide range of communication interfaces, simplifying baseboard development.</p>",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Sep 01 2026 01:15:43 GMT+0000",
      "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
